  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q5q8](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q5q8) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 12.587 depth occurred on Apr 13 2025 5km SW of Kuglik. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 39.0139 longitude 70.6634. It impacted 89792 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
